WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.800
Hace veinticinco años,

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.040
a woman was brought

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.360
to fertility clinic in Scranton.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.360
She had a bodyguard and

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.680
the head doctor was willing to

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.320
overlook her age and take the risk

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.520
of artificial insemination.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.320
Your husband made it very clear

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.680
how badly you want children.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:32.440
Well,

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.520
let's take the risk then.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.360
Nine months later,

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:48.080
she gave birth to a baby girl.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:49.640
You.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.080
There is a mistake.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.240
Here, my mom's name is listed

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.600
as Tiffany Gallagher,

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:03.600
but my mom is Mia Rose.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:06.760
That person never existed.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:09.160
What?
